  "label": "Meme Template: 'I Want It Now Is a Good Time'",
  "description": "This is a widely circulated internet meme format that uses a specific image of a young boy with a determined expression and raised fist to convey impatience or urgent desire. The template is often used humorously or emphatically to express a strong, immediate want for something, regardless of context. The image and text combination is culturally recognized as a shorthand for demanding something right now.",
